<</DA(/Helv 8 Tf 0 0 0 rg)/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/Kids[ 215 0 R ]/Q 0/Sejda 293 0 R /T(textarea_48lxhq)/V(Rift Step \(momentary portal within line of sight, half action at speed 10, teleport up to 6m, once per short rest\)\r\nEnhanced Predator's Bite \(1d6 + might, piercing\)\r\nFeeding \(heal a number of blood equal to half of any damage dealt by your bite, includes latch\)\r\nLatch \(may choose to latch onto the target, target becomes grappled until they break free or you release, while latched you deal 1d4 piercing damage automatically at the start of each round\)\r\nIntimidating Presence \(force an enemy to make a DN 16 resolve test or be frightened for 1d4 rounds, once per rest\)\r\nPredator's scent \(detect creatures within 5m by scent alone, even through walls or in total darkness\))>>
endobj
